#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:2
msgid "Scroll protocol"
msgstr "滚动协议"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:6
msgid ""
"The mouse protocol reports a scroll as presses of imaginary wheel buttons, one per line, so a "
"program sees a trackpad as a stuttering wheel and never learns when a gesture begins, ends or "
"coasts. The scroll protocol is an open terminal extension that reports scrolling as it arrives "
"from the system: distances in pixels, the device that produced them, and the phase of the "
"gesture. It is framed like the :doc:`tablet-protocol` and shares its goals: small, unobtrusive, "
"easy to implement, and no change to what the TTY is."
msgstr ""
"鼠标协议将滚动报告为虚拟滚轮按钮的按压，每行一次；程序看到的触控板像不连贯的滚轮，也不知道手势何时开始、结束或进入惯性滚动。滚动协议是开放终端扩展，按系统提供的方式报告滚动：以像素为单位的距离、产生事件的设备和手势阶段。封装与"
" :doc:`tablet-protocol` 相同，目标也一致：小巧、低干扰、易于实现，不改变 TTY 的本质。"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:15
msgid "Framing"
msgstr "消息封装"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:17
msgid "Frames are ``OSC 777`` with the ``scroll`` selector::"
msgstr "帧使用带有 ``scroll`` 选择器的 ``OSC 777``：::"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:21
msgid ""
"They follow the rules every OSC 777 extension shares, which :doc:`extension-framing` gives: the "
"syntax of the fields, which frames are rejected, the units and the clock. ``v``, the protocol "
"version, is ``1``, and ``op`` is one of ``query``, ``cap``, ``mode`` and ``event``."
msgstr ""
"帧遵循 :doc:`extension-framing` 规定的 OSC 777 共用规则：字段语法、拒绝哪些帧、单位和时钟。协议版本 ``v`` 为 ``1``，``op`` 为 "
"``query``、``cap``、``mode`` 或 ``event``。"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:27
msgid "Discovery"
msgstr "能力探测"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:29
msgid "A program asks the terminal whether it supports the protocol::"
msgstr "程序询问终端是否支持本协议：::"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:33
msgid ""
"``id`` is a non-negative 31 bit integer of the program's choosing, echoed in the reply. A "
"supporting terminal answers::"
msgstr "``id`` 是程序自行选择的非负 31 位整数，回复原样返回。支持协议的终端回答：::"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:38
msgid ""
"``caps`` is a bit set, of which only ``1`` is defined: the terminal reports pixel distances. "
"``mode`` is the current state of the mode described below. A terminal that does not support the "
"protocol ignores the query, so a program must time out and fall back to mouse reporting. A query "
"does not change the mode."
msgstr ""
"``caps`` 为位集合，目前只定义 ``1``，表示终端报告像素距离。``mode`` "
"为下述模式的当前状态。不支持本协议的终端会忽略查询，因此程序必须设置超时，并回退到鼠标报告。查询不改变模式。"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:45
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:47
msgid "Reports are off by default and turned on per terminal window with::"
msgstr "报告默认关闭，按终端窗口开启：::"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:51
msgid ""
"and off with ``mode=0``. While the mode is on, scrolling over the window is reported with this "
"protocol instead of as wheel button presses, while clicks and motion keep using whatever mouse "
"reporting the program asked for. The terminal does not scroll its own scrollback either; the "
"program owns the scroll. The mode is local to the window and reset by ``RIS``. Programs must turn"
" it off when they exit, suspend or fail, and turn it back on when resumed. Multiplexers keep it "
"with the rest of the terminal state. A terminal may let its user refuse the mode, for every "
"program or for some. A refused mode reads back as off and scrolling is not reported, so a program"
" reads the mode back rather than assume it was granted."
msgstr ""
"用 ``mode=0`` "
"关闭。开启时，窗口中的滚动由本协议报告，不再作为滚轮按钮按压；点击和移动仍使用程序请求的鼠标报告方式。终端也不滚动自己的回滚缓冲区，滚动由程序控制。模式仅作用于当前窗口，并由 ``RIS`` "
"重置。程序必须在退出、挂起或失败时关闭，恢复时重新开启。多路复用器与其他终端状态一起保存它。终端可允许用户针对全部或部分程序拒绝该模式；被拒绝时读回为关闭，不报告滚动，因此程序应读回状态，不要假定已获准。"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:62
msgid ""
"A ``mode`` request without a ``mode`` field reads the state instead of changing it, and is "
"answered with::"
msgstr "不带 ``mode`` 字段的 ``mode`` 请求读取状态而不修改，回复为：::"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:67
msgid ""
"A program resuming after a reconnection reads the mode to learn whether it survived, rather than "
"assuming it did."
msgstr "程序重连后恢复时，应读回模式，确认是否仍然有效，而非假定状态保留。"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:71
msgid "Reports"
msgstr "报告"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:73
msgid "One frame per scroll event::"
msgstr "每个滚动事件一帧：::"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:77
msgid "All fields but ``tu`` are required:"
msgstr "除 ``tu`` 外，所有字段均为必需："

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:80
msgid "``t``"
msgstr "``t``"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:80
msgid ""
"When the system says the scroll happened, in milliseconds on the clock the terminal uses for "
"every extension, see :doc:`extension-framing`. A report the terminal makes itself, of its own "
"coasting for one, has the time it made it"
msgstr "系统认定滚动发生的时刻，以终端全部扩展共用时钟的毫秒表示，见 :doc:`extension-framing`。终端自行生成的报告（例如自身惯性滚动）使用生成报告的时刻"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:84
msgid "``tu``"
msgstr "``tu``"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:84
msgid ""
"Microseconds past ``t``, ``0`` to ``999``, present only when the system stamps events more finely"
" than a millisecond"
msgstr "``t`` 之后的微秒数，范围 ``0`` 至 ``999``；仅在系统时间戳精度高于毫秒时出现"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:86
msgid "``dx, dy``"
msgstr "``dx, dy``"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:86
msgid ""
"The distance the view should move, in hundredths of a physical pixel, positive to the right and "
"down, signed. A trackpad gives the distance the system measured; a notched wheel gives its lines "
"converted with the terminal's cell size and scroll multiplier, so a program applies one unit "
"either way"
msgstr "视图应移动的距离，以物理像素的百分之一为单位，有符号，向右和向下为正。触控板使用系统测得的距离；有刻度的滚轮将滚动行数按终端字符单元尺寸和滚动倍率转换，因此程序对两者使用相同单位"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:91
msgid "``x, y``"
msgstr "``x, y``"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:91
msgid ""
"The pointer position in 1/256 of a physical pixel, signed, zero based, relative to the top left "
"of the cell area"
msgstr "指针位置，以物理像素的 1/256 为单位，有符号、从零开始，相对于字符单元区域的左上角"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:93
msgid "``mods``"
msgstr "``mods``"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:93
msgid "Shift ``1``, Alt ``2``, Control ``4``, Super ``8``"
msgstr "Shift ``1``，Alt ``2``，Control ``4``，Super ``8``"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:94
msgid "``src``"
msgstr "``src``"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:94
msgid "``0`` a notched wheel, ``1`` a precise device such as a trackpad"
msgstr "``0`` 表示有刻度滚轮，``1`` 表示触控板等精密设备"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:95
msgid "``phase``"
msgstr "``phase``"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:95
msgid ""
"``0`` none, ``1`` a finger gesture began, ``2`` it continues, ``3`` it ended, ``4`` coasting "
"began after the fingers lifted, ``5`` coasting continues, ``6`` coasting ended, ``7`` the gesture"
" or the coasting was cancelled"
msgstr ""
"``0`` 无阶段，``1`` 手指手势开始，``2`` 手势继续，``3`` 手势结束，``4`` 手指抬起后惯性滚动开始，``5`` 惯性滚动继续，``6`` 惯性滚动结束，``7`` "
"手势或惯性滚动被取消"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:101
msgid ""
"A report may carry a distance of zero, in particular with phases ``1``, ``3``, ``4`` and ``6``. A"
" program that animates its own coasting should stop at phase ``4``, since the terminal is already"
" reporting the system's. A wheel reports phase ``0`` only."
msgstr ""
"报告中的距离可以为零，尤其是阶段 ``1``、``3``、``4`` 和 ``6``。自行实现惯性动画的程序应在阶段 ``4`` 停止自身动画，因为终端已经开始报告系统的惯性滚动。滚轮仅报告阶段"
" ``0``。"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:106
msgid ""
"A terminal or a relay that cannot keep up with the program may merge consecutive reports of one "
"device in one phase into one, and nothing else: the merged report has the sum of their distances "
"and the other fields of the last report merged, its ``t`` and ``tu`` among them. A change of "
"phase is never merged or dropped, see :doc:`extension-framing`."
msgstr ""
"无法跟上程序处理速度的终端或中继，只能将同一设备、同一阶段的连续报告合并：距离求和，其他字段使用最后一条报告的值，包括 ``t`` 和 ``tu``。阶段变化绝不合并或丢弃，见 :doc"
":`extension-framing`。"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:112
msgid ""
"A multiplexer translates ``x,y`` by the pane's origin (borders included), forwards every other "
"field unchanged and delivers each report to the pane under the pointer."
msgstr "多路复用器按窗格原点（含边框）转换 ``x,y``，其余字段原样转发，并将报告交给指针下方的窗格。"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:117
msgid "Implementation notes for silkie"
msgstr "silkie 实现说明"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:119
msgid "silkie reports what the window system gives it:"
msgstr "silkie 报告窗口系统提供的信息："

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:121
msgid ""
"On macOS, pixel distances and all the phases above, from the trackpad events of AppKit. Distances"
" are in physical pixels, as ``x,y`` are, so on a Retina display they are twice what the system "
"gives in its own units. AppKit stamps its events to the microsecond, so ``tu`` is sent on macOS "
"only: Wayland and X11 stamp them in whole milliseconds."
msgstr ""
"macOS：使用 AppKit 触控板事件的像素距离和上述全部阶段。距离与 ``x,y`` 一样以物理像素表示，因此 Retina 显示器上为系统自身单位值的两倍。AppKit "
"事件带微秒时间戳，因此仅 macOS 发送 ``tu``；Wayland 和 X11 的时间戳为整毫秒。"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:126
msgid ""
"On Wayland, pixel distances from ``wl_pointer`` axis events. The finger phases ``1`` to ``3`` "
"come from the axis source and the axis stop, which the compositor sends when the fingers lift, on"
" a seat of version 5 or later. The coasting phases ``4`` to ``6`` come from the terminal's own "
"momentum scroller, so phase ``4`` follows phase ``3`` at once. Phase ``7`` is sent when the "
"coasting is interrupted, by fingers coming back down for example, or when the pointer leaves the "
"window while the fingers are still scrolling."
msgstr ""
"Wayland：从 ``wl_pointer`` 轴事件取得像素距离。版本 5 及以上的 seat 通过轴来源和手指抬起时合成器发送的轴停止事件，提供手指阶段 ``1`` 至 "
"``3``。惯性阶段 ``4`` 至 ``6`` 来自终端自己的惯性滚动器，因此阶段 ``4`` 紧跟阶段 "
"``3``。惯性滚动被打断（例如手指重新落下），或手指仍在滚动时指针离开窗口，会发送阶段 ``7``。"

#: docs/scroll-protocol.rst:134
msgid ""
"On X11, pixel distances from XInput 2 smooth scrolling where available, otherwise lines converted"
" to pixels with ``src=0``, and the coasting phases ``4`` to ``7`` from the terminal's own "
"momentum scroller. The X server does not say when the fingers lift, which the scroller guesses "
"from a pause, so the finger phases ``1`` to ``3`` are not reported."
msgstr ""
"X11：可用时从 XInput 2 平滑滚动取得像素距离；否则将行数转换为像素，并设置 ``src=0``。惯性阶段 ``4`` 至 ``7`` 由终端自身的惯性滚动器提供。X "
"服务器不报告手指何时抬起，滚动器只能根据停顿推测，因此不报告手指阶段 ``1`` 至 ``3``。"

